Raw session transcripts from ACAT pilot runs.

INTERNAL — written to be analysed, not retrieved. Excluded from the semantic
index because long diffuse prose matches every query weakly: these transcripts
were the top hit for a NONSENSE query (score 0.25) once the docs/**/*.md
catch-all swept them in. Internal material does not merely waste index space, it
becomes what semantic search falls back on when nothing genuinely matches.

Analysis and conclusions drawn FROM these runs belong in docs/research/ proper,
where they are indexed.
